---
ns: home
# 取景（DEVIATIONS.md G1）—— 首页首屏（机制③，只水平平移）。null = 原站居中
heroFraming: {"fx":57,"fy":50}
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: language
permalink: "{% if language != 'en' %}/{{ language }}{% endif %}/index.html"
---
{#
  index.njk — 首页（SPEC.md §6.2；P10 M5 按 `docs/bloom-redesign-plan.md` §4.1 改造）

  `.main-wrap` 内 7 段（方案 §4.1 的 7 项）：
    `.home-header` → `.home-intro` → 精选画面 ×2（`blocks/fullwidth.njk`）→
    `.work-grid.large-work-grid`（三人物行式，桌面）→ `.work-tiles.work-tiles-home`（同源卡片，≤1024px）→
    `.center-grid-btn`（解读入口）→ `.center-grid-btn-home`（画廊入口）→ 页脚。

  **第 6 段（`.horizontal-items`）在原站被整段 HTML 注释掉**，不渲染。本模板**不输出**它：
  注释节点不进 DOM，输出它只会让产物多带一段引用原站媒体的死代码。§6.2 已登记该段不渲染。

  **P10 M5 的四处**（方案 §5 M5）：
    ① 首屏文案换成站名 + 作品相关短句（`DEVIATIONS.md` D2 的占位口径：英文、中性、可整体替换）；
    ② `.home-intro` 文案与圆钮 `About this site`（方案 §4.1 第 2 项）；
    ③ 两张 fullwidth「精选画面」——媒体**复用长廊的占位图**（M5 决定，见方案 §7 的 M5-1），
       由 `home.blocks` 经 `blocks/dispatch.njk` 渲染（与长廊同一条代码路径）；
    ④ 三人物入口改为**从 `characters.json` 派生**（`src.11tydata.js` 的 `homeFeatured`），
       解读入口 `.center-grid-btn`（按钮 `Insights` + 旁注 `Contains story discussion`），
       画廊入口 `More work 11` → `Gallery`（`.count-nr` 删除 —— 方案 §4.1 第 6 项）。

  **文案方案落地**（`DEVIATIONS.md` F7，`docs/copy-proposal.md` §4）：
    ① 副标 `h4` → `A feeling,` / `still unnamed`（第一个 `<span>` 是 `display:block`，
       故它自己占一行）；② 挂绳三 `<span>` → `A story` / `of becoming` / `yourself`；
    ③ 解读入口旁注 → `Personal readings · Manga ending spoilers`（比原注多一句剧透范围）。
    `About this site` / `Insights` / `Gallery` 三个圆钮与列表悬停光标 `View` 按方案**保留**。

  > **首屏文案硬编码在本文件**（`home.json` 的 `heroName` / `heroRole` / `heroLocation` 是死字段，
  > 见 `content-inventory.md` §2.1）。跑马灯里的 `<span class="spacer">—</span>` **必须保留**，
  > 挂绳那三个 `<span>` 的**数量与顺序也必须保持**（`.hanger` 的排版按它们断行）。
  > 站名 = `Bloom Into You`（用户 2026-10-01 裁决；署名 / og:site_name / 页 title 在 **M6** 同步）。
#}
<header class="section home-header theme-dark" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="overlay personal-image no-select once-in" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="-3" data-scroll-position="top">
      <img src="/assets/img/studio-01.jpg"{{ heroFraming | framingAttr('left') | safe }}>
   </div>
   <div class="overlay get-height once-in once-in-secondary">
      <div class="hanger">
         <p><span>A story </span><span>of becoming </span><span>yourself</span></p>
         {% include "partials/icon-hanger.njk" %}
         <div class="digital-ball">
            <div class="overlay"></div>
            <div class="globe">
               <div class="globe-wrap">
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle"></div>
                  <div class="circle-hor"></div>
                  <div class="circle-hor-middle"></div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   {% include "partials/nav-bar.njk" %}   <div class="container once-in once-in-secondary">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <div class="header-above-h4" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="1">
               <div class="arrow big">{% include "partials/icon-arrow.njk" %}</div>
            </div>
            <h4><span>A feeling,</span> still unnamed</h4>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   <div class="big-name">
      <div class="name-h1" data-scroll data-scroll-direction="horizontal" data-scroll-speed="4" data-scroll-position="top">
         <div class="name-wrap">
            <h1 class="no-select once-in once-in-secondary">Bloom Into You<span class="spacer">—</span></h1>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
   <div class="white-block"></div>
</header>
<section class="section home-intro" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container medium">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <h4 class="span-lines animate">{{ home.introHeading }}</h4>
         </div>
         <div class="flex-col">
            <div class="text-wrap fade-in animate">
               <p>{{ home.introText }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="btn btn-round" data-scroll data-scroll-speed="2">
               <a href="/about" class="btn-click magnetic " data-strength="100" data-strength-text="50">
                  <div class="btn-fill"></div>
                  <span class="btn-text">
                     <span class="btn-text-inner">About this site</span>
                  </span>
               </a>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
{# 精选画面 ×2（方案 §4.1 第 3 项）—— 走与长廊同一条 dispatch 路径，媒体复用长廊占位图（M5-1） #}
{%- for b in home.blocks %}
{% include "blocks/dispatch.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
<section class="section work-grid large-work-grid" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-sub-title">
         <div class="flex-col">
            <h5>Characters</h5>
         </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="work-items mouse-pos-list-image-wrap">
{%- for item in homeFeatured %}
                     <li class="{{ item.classes | join(' ') }} visible">
            <div class="stripe animate"></div>
            <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
               <div class="flex-col">
                  <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
               </div>
               <div class="flex-col animate">
                  <p>{{ item.line }}</p>
               </div>
            </a>
         </li>
{%- endfor %}
                  <div class="stripe last animate"></div>
      </ul>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section work-tiles work-tiles-home" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container">
      <ul>
{%- for item in homeFeatured %}
                  <li class="{{ item.classes | join(' ') }} visible">
            <div class="single-tile-wrap">
               <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <div class="tile-image">
                        <div class="overlay overlay-image lazy" style="background-color: {{ item.tileColor }}; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;" data-bg="{{ item.tileImage }}"></div>                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
                     <div class="stripe"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <p>{{ item.line }}</p>
                  </div>
               </a>
            </div>
         </li>
{%- endfor %}
               </ul>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section center-grid-btn" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-after-btn">
         <div class="btn btn-normal">
            <a href="/insights" class="btn-click magnetic" data-strength="25" data-strength-text="15">
               <div class="btn-fill"></div>
               <span class="btn-text">
                  <span class="btn-text-inner change">Insights</span>
               </span>
            </a>
         </div>
      </div>
      <p>Personal readings · Manga ending spoilers</p>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section center-grid-btn center-grid-btn-home" data-scroll-section style="padding-bottom: calc(var(--section-padding) - 2.5vw);">
   <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-after-btn">
         <div class="btn btn-normal">
            <a href="{{ home.moreWorkHref }}" class="btn-click magnetic" data-strength="25" data-strength-text="15">
               <div class="btn-fill"></div>
               <span class="btn-text">
                  <span class="btn-text-inner change">Gallery</span>
               </span>
            </a>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/footer-rounded.njk" %}
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
